docs {
  # Check Email Existance
  
  This endpoint would allow you to check whether an already registered email is being entered for registration again. 
  
  ## 200 OK
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Email is available."
  }
  ```
  
  ## 400 Bad Request
  If you do not follow the request structure appropriately or if your JSON fields fail validation, this arises. Please refer to the `Body` section of this request to see the structure.
  ```json
  {
    "message": "The request is malformed."
  }
  ```
  
  ## 409 Conflict
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Email already registered."
  }
  ```
  
  ## 500 Internal Server Error
  This arises, due to issues in the server code. Report to the backend team immediately if you see this. Make sure to check the server logs in-case this happens.
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Oops! Something happened. Please try again later."
  }
  ```
}
